{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfrvaq2QnH2iFTnhT4vhQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The root cause was mutable default arguments in `inv/warehouse.py`. The fix is in place and `tests/test_inv.py` passes (1 passed).\n\n**Root cause:** Python evaluates default values once, at function definition time, so every `Warehouse` created without explicit arguments shared the same objects:\n- `stock={}` meant all warehouses shared one stock dict, so stock from the first warehouse showed up in the second.\n- `history=[]` meant all warehouses shared one history list.\n- `tags=[]` in `restock` meant every new `Item` created without tags got the same list object.\n\n**Fix** (`inv/warehouse.py`):\n- `__init__` now takes `stock=None` and `history=None`, and creates a fresh `{}` / `[]` for each instance when `None` is passed. An explicitly passed dict or list is still used as-is.\n- `restock` takes `tags=None`. A new item gets `list(tags)` (a copy of the caller's list) or a fresh `[]`, so items never share a tags list.\n\nI didn't touch the test. Beyond the existing test, I checked by hand that two warehouses no longer share history, stock, or tags, that `ship` and repeated `restock` calls stay isolated, and that passing an explicit `stock` dict still works. All of those passed. I did not add these cases to the test file.\n\nThe repo has only one test file, so this isn't a full regression suite. I didn't run any other tests because there aren't any."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3764,"cache_read_input_tokens":45567,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3764},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8e19917-306f-4bfa-9875-e8c72de6d576","uuid":"50296a4b-2b6d-4908-865b-e0ba7cd4ff8e","timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:47:15.096Z","request_id":"req_011CfrvapiJg1Dehw4W1DQh3"}
